        System Models of Distributed Systems
      </h1>
      <div class="h-1.5 w-24 bg-indigo-600 mx-auto my-4 rounded-full"></div>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-700 font-semibold leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto m-0">
