        <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-900 font-medium">
          Clients request services and servers provide those services. Simple to manage and secure, but vulnerable to server bottlenecks.
        </p>
      </Card>

      <Card title="Multi-Tier" badge="Layered Architecture" glow="cyan">
