        </p>
      </Card>

      <Card title="Peer-to-Peer" badge="Symmetric Roles" glow="rose">
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-700 font-bold mb-1">Decentralized resource mesh.</p>
        <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-900 font-medium">
          Nodes share symmetric roles, acting as both consumers and providers of compute and storage without a permanent central server.
        </p>
      </Card>
    </div>
